note om2_param_slots: six parameter slots; an unsized view T * or edit T * takes two (pointer, count), every other parameter one
note here 2 unsized views (4 slots) plus 2 scalars fill all six; a sized view uchar 4 would take one slot
om2
fn f a view uchar * b view uchar * x int y int to int
ret int add add len a len b ulong add x y
end
fn g a view uchar 4 b view uchar 4 c view uchar 4 x int y int z int to int
ret add add x y z
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 4 0
b = new uchar 3 0
c = new uchar 4 0
d = new uchar 4 0
r = f a b 1 2
if ne r 10
ret 1
end
s = g a c d 1 2 3
if ne s 6
ret 2
end
ret 0
end
